> A calculation before fitting

A uniform distribution over70 target classes gives probability1/70 and negative log likelihood log(70) per scored token. Padding is excluded by the actual objective; greedy sequence accuracy is a separate quantity.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/roberta_tweaks_worked.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -lpthread -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
